{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"4f7f6507edd4eceb","type":"group","x":-3640,"y":-4860,"width":7400,"height":4620,"color":"4","label":"The Kris Krises"},
		{"id":"1baa5f3a197de85c","type":"group","x":-3600,"y":-4840,"width":7320,"height":4040,"color":"3","label":"krisdreemurrkris"},
		{"id":"ca57fc9001860b76","type":"group","x":-3100,"y":-780,"width":1760,"height":500,"color":"3","label":"Kris D'vina"},
		{"id":"032c908ecc2b0664","type":"group","x":-3600,"y":-780,"width":450,"height":260,"color":"1","label":"Yes, There's Multiple"},
		{"id":"5db853ff35a30908","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Canvases/Kris/The Lake.canvas","portal":true,"x":480,"y":-1800,"width":3200,"height":880},
		{"id":"b00fcb1713031f4c","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Canvases/Kris/Kris Q&A.md","x":1600,"y":-4740,"width":740,"height":2890,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"49ff26a339a88775",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This is a screenshot of Kris D'vina's room, sure, but I'm more focused on the asker being represented by a single period and the question itself, especially directly after last question. Then again, Kris did just blow them off... Then again again, is that really out of character even in a serious situation?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-2160,
			"width":460,
			"height":180,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"0de2dbc2896cc8fb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Probably just further illustration that they miss their family.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-1940,
			"width":460,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"afe253f872fa031a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"My gut feeling may be correct about the VoidCrystal, if this isn't just an unrealized fear.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-2300,
			"width":460,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"f82b9fefc7328dbf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Kris' played this piece before, in the dining room of the Holiday House (kris_piano_waitingroom). They recognize it, but seem uncertain if they've actually played it themselves for some reason. Might be important, might just be further characterizing the anonymous person in [[MOURNINGDEW Phenomina.canvas]]. Unclear at this juncture. ...What does Kris mean by that at the end, though?\nAlso, Kris, if you monitor this board at all - [the song you're looking for is on musescore!](https://musescore.com/user/28747830/scores/5249363)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-2640,
			"width":460,
			"height":280,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"714cd7af7e6c17c0","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Canvases/Kris/The Device.canvas","portal":true,"x":-1860,"y":-4800,"width":3420,"height":3000},
		{
			"id":"ad67c1839965a0d1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Yeah... yeah. You're seen, in this regard.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-2860,
			"width":460,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"fda6596772216847",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Kris Dreemurr, dodging the question? Say it ain't so /j\n\n...But no. We haven't. Not exactly, anyways.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-2980,
			"width":460,
			"height":100,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"97e71e7fd7fb6144",
			"type":"file",
			"file":"Conspiracy Board/Canvases/Kris/Kris' Timeline.canvas",
			"portal":true,
			"x":-998,
			"y":-1518,
			"width":1480,
			"height":700,
			"interdimensionalEdges":[
				{
					"id":"03815c78b0b50456",
					"styleAttributes":{},
					"toFloating":false,
					"fromFloating":false,
					"fromNode":"33f900fc7a8d0819",
					"fromSide":"right",
					"toNode":"acportal||97e71e7fd7fb6144||3bbf5bd423f74cc2",
					"toSide":"left",
					"color":"4"
				},
				{
					"id":"24d756f15cb5c5ff",
					"styleAttributes":{},
					"toFloating":false,
					"fromNode":"ff40d377e4df8c0e",
					"fromSide":"right",
					"toNode":"acportal||97e71e7fd7fb6144||3bbf5bd423f74cc2",
					"toSide":"left",
					"color":"4"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id":"9564f0c024d5c56e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"*A Hat In Time's Alpha Bookstore?* Referenced **here?** With the snow, and melody, and... huh. I wonder what this is about; honestly. It's very clearly intentional, at this point, and Kris has even called out that they were the same themselves...\n\nI'm pondering it.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-3670,
			"width":460,
			"height":200,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"ff40d377e4df8c0e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"About that last one... Don't you think something seems off...?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1308,
			"y":-1325,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"33f900fc7a8d0819","type":"link","url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vvHnpyFiO_k","x":-1688,"y":-1184,"width":640,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"5794380380c64dd9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Who is Kris referring to here?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2158,
			"y":-1422,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"146a91c4ae55129c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Choosing to believe them on this; as much as they're a scamp we're in this much together as a group; methinks.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-3860,
			"width":460,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"6d8fb99d379b2691",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"From one of the Excalidraw boards.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2369,
			"y":-1906,
			"width":260,
			"height":72,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"bfdfcd8b4ce75220",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"*You don't like looking at this sort of thing.\n§ Wait, what was that *?\n                                                                -Kris \\[Blotched out with Black Ink\\]\n                                                                \n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2650,
			"y":-2016,
			"width":530,
			"height":90,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"a8bdf4bd0eb8bf69",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Linking it to Noelle's blog seems to imply whatever this page is actually about involves both Kris & Noelle.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2400,
			"y":-1016,
			"width":260,
			"height":192,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"6901ca51ee43da5e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"In reference to a 'Green Diamond' in someone's Consultation.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2650,
			"y":-2106,
			"width":400,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"89b7808dd1b175dd","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/krisdreemurrkris/Important Person's Shirt A.png","x":-2655,"y":-2673,"width":283,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"c3da14ca338f91ef",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"§ Sup, Pearl?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2650,
			"y":-1846,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"51936bfcb827ae16","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/Lake.png","x":-3165,"y":-2680,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"89457a68dbf51514","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/krisdreemurrkris/Important Person's Shirt B.png","x":-2627,"y":-2235,"width":226,"height":29,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3d1900dbef0db239","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Round 2/Kris consultation B.png","x":-2876,"y":-1464,"width":441,"height":460},
		{"id":"39072fe0f939818b","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/krisdreemurrkris/Kris' consultation screenshot (lq).png","x":-3104,"y":-2108,"width":400,"height":364},
		{
			"id":"b3654c65c5c0c62e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clearly as capable of modifying the game for different answers as we are.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3034,
			"y":-1720,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"7c1878473bbcede1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This hits close to home. It isn't wrong to hope, in our view... and for their sake; I hope this isn't a story where we have to choose between MOURNINGDEW and DELTARUNE.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-4280,
			"width":480,
			"height":100,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"a9a866ebbf7bcc7c","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Canvases/Kris/Before The Story.canvas","portal":true,"x":-3560,"y":-4800,"width":1680,"height":2040},
		{"id":"f93d53cd8f88775e","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Discord Hints/Oh, the poor children!.png","x":-1810,"y":-477,"width":398,"height":54,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"e5c1fe638191dfb1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"'That night in the woods' can't have happened in a world where Dess was never lost. What does referring to it here mean??",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1811,
			"y":-398,
			"width":400,
			"height":86,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"590b49b53bd54b06","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Kris' Birth.md","x":-2240,"y":-755,"width":400,"height":443,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"9e879d06ff347355","type":"link","url":"https://mourningdew.phinarina.xyz/kris_dvina_kris/","x":-2645,"y":-751,"width":365,"height":439},
		{
			"id":"c57de21c45f8e167",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"They, really are all happy, aren't they?\n\nYet, when I look at them... it's as if I dont even know who I'm looking at.\n\nI'll show them... that not all roads have to lead to the same place.\n\nThat there's another side, as long as you're able to go outside of the lines...\n\nSoon.\n\n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@krisdreemurrkris",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1818,
			"y":-1560,
			"width":480,
			"height":335,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"b637d816cea66643","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/krisdreemurrkris/Kris hints at kris_dvina_kris Page.png","x":-2098,"y":-1093,"width":400,"height":269,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"658ace554eec80e4","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/Kris D'vina/Kris Sick.png","x":-2849,"y":-672,"width":164,"height":145,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"2457d1d6d96692c9","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/Kris D'vina/Kris Sick B.png","x":-3080,"y":-672,"width":177,"height":98,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e11a876cd4ff3cab","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Discord Hints/Multiple Krises One.png","x":-3580,"y":-748,"width":400,"height":57,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1e6c8dc4942df8bd","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Discord Hints/Multiple Krises Two.png","x":-3580,"y":-663,"width":400,"height":133,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"515d1db5d1f1856a","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/krisdreemurrkris/Kris Account.png","x":-3544,"y":-2108,"width":399,"height":82},
		{"id":"464c0d71bd14601b","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Kris/krisdreemurrkris/Can anyone try to recognize December.png","x":-3545,"y":-1988,"width":400,"height":91},
		{
			"id":"9aeaf5dd9be93853",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Kris is right, how *did* we get to see this, exactly? We don't have many clues about what the voices could be; unless it's about what was going on with PENNY in the second video.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-4120,
			"width":380,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"0de086b2374a84e5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"As much as we were *joking* about there being a 'new rock by the water...' This *is* the same sort of situation the \"player character\" in FRLG.IPS was in - except that Kris is outside of DELTARUNE; now that it's deprecated.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-4540,
			"width":320,
			"height":200,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"2d9a1b54db746c3e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Is that 'someone else' who's messing with Kris, maybe...?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2380,
			"y":-4640,
			"width":400,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"372f865e71172971",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This is clearly one of the Krises narrating, and I'm FAIRLY sure it's Dreemurr in spite of the section sign usage due to it being at the lake.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3525,
			"y":-2351,
			"width":360,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"cdd97f21dcd7af7a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"§ It’s just within reach. If you just wiggle your hand… \n§ …if you could only move your hand like so…",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3095,
			"y":-2341,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"c9f75d6c6fab6d5a","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Round 1/Kris consultation A.png","x":-3253,"y":-1538,"width":360,"height":623},
		{
			"id":"c7bc4975dcff77f5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Playing up the fact they aren't exactly fond of themselves, here, with their consultation? Then again, not like I've heard of a Kris having a good experience with Therapy.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-3560,
			"y":-1214,
			"width":260,
			"height":200,
			"color":"1"
		}
	],
